The list of tools that need to be installed on the Tester
1- T-Rex >= 3.04 (https://trex-tgn.cisco.com/trex/release/)
     The tester drives T-Rex via its Python stateless API.  Install
     T-Rex from the Cisco tarball and add its automation/trex_control_plane/
     interactive/ to PYTHONPATH, or use the trex-stl-lib==0.3 PyPI shim
     for offline / CI smoke tests.
2- scapy (pip)
     Required to (re)build the per-testbed pcaps via
     pcap/build_pcaps.py --dst-mac <SUT_rcv MAC>
3- numpy (pip)
